  E(X^2) &=& \sum_{x=0}^2 x^2~P(X=x) = 0 \times 0.19+
  1 \times 0.07+4 \times 0.74 =3.03.
  \end{aligned}\] De modo que
  \(V(X) = E(X^2) - \left\{E(X)\right\}^2 = 0.63\).

